wherein HD is a node feature matrix of the 1-th layer, each row of which corresponds to a feature vector of a node, Â is a normalized version of an adjacency matrix A of the graph, D is a degree matrix, I is an identity matrix, WD is a learnable weight matrix of the 1-th layer, and σ is an activation function.
